# Soccer photo jersey backs (always)

**One silhouette.** Morocco / Spain / Cameroon / PSG is the garment: same camera, crop, slim short-sleeve cut, crew collar shape, sleeve length, drape. Do not invent a new shirt. Per team, **only** recolor body / collar / cuffs / side panels and print that team’s wordmark.

**Plate:** solid `#000000` backdrop (LED energy — black pixels stay off). No gray studio, no locker wood. No hanger.

**Wordmark:** TOP at inner collar; same Cameroon arch. Same letter height as Cameroon/Morocco. Fill ~65% width unless the name would leave the fabric. Two-word names stop before the second word falls off. Spell IVORY COAST, DR CONGO, MOZAMBIQUE.

**Colors (not a new cut):** Tanzania = royal blue + yellow. Ethiopia = green + white collar. Zambia = copper/orange (green is away). Never clone Cameroon’s yellow-red collar onto another nation.

**One kit per cycle:** `*-proposed.png` + `soccer-jersey-review.html`. Replace live only after acknowledge.

